OL,3,GNEWSANurse's death after misdiagnosed
OL,4,Acondition 'needless'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a nurse who died just
OL,7,Fdays after her life-threatening heart
OL,8,Fcondition was misdiagnosed have said
OL,9,Fher "needless" death has left them
OL,10,F"devastated".
OL,12,FPaula Ivers went to Tameside General
OL,13,FHospital with chest pain but was sent
OL,14,Fhome after being told it was acid
OL,15,Freflux, her inquest heard.
OL,17,FThe 47-year-old children's nurse died
OL,18,Fthree days later at her home in Denton,
OL,19,FTameside, in March 2024. A coroner
OL,20,Fconcluded the death was contributed to
OL,21,Fby neglect.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
